WEBVTT

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.268
Are you focused?

00:05:00.292 --> 00:05:01.559
Are you skilled?

00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:02.851
Are you intuitive?

00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:05.559
Are you expressive, creative, aware?

00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:10.542
So I want to talk to you today
about your how in your life.

00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:13.976
So we do a little bit of --

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.518
we spend a little time
in existential crisis

00:05:16.542 --> 00:05:19.518
over "Why am I here?
What am I meant to be doing?"

00:05:19.542 --> 00:05:23.351
and we put a ton of effort
into our what --

00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:27.684
our job, our career,
our partner that we have

00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:31.476
and the hobbies we pursue.